  itemName: Wusun Curved Horn Saber
  tags:
  - Equipment
  description: A prairie curved saber left behind by the Wusun elite brought by Chang
    Hui after lifting the siege of Jushi. The back of the blade is reinforced with
    Xiongnu curved horns, far sharper than standard Han sabers. A general leading
    the charge with this can inspire troops.
